Hi all,

Just started a new game of nethack yesterday and decided for once to keep
my kitten.  He was starting to get pretty strong, but then something better
happened.  I was in the mines and decided to knock over a store.  I slept the
shop keeper and started to beat the bejesus out of him.  I succeeded, but
the watch captains came along and started beating the bj out of me.
My house cat kept hitting them but wasn't doing that much damage, so I cross
my fingers and zap him with a wand of polymorph, he turns into a Lich!
Pixel the Lich then makes short work of the guards and I now have a pet Lich
The only problem I foresee is accidentally leaving him behind and having him
go feral.

Pete


